Common EdFi.StudentCharacteristic additions
descriptor LevelOfIntegration
    documentation "This field holds the level of integration that represents the amount of service for GIFTED characteristic students only
                    Valid values are:
                    1 = Less than 10% of the day (minimum or 'A')
                    2 = 11% to 49% of the day (moderate or 'B')
                    3 = 50% of the day or more, but not a full day (extensive or 'C')
                    4 = Up to a full day or program 3Y/4Y (maximum or 'D')"
    is optional
    role name GiftedLevelOfIntegration

// START: Chang ID 252617 Foster Care
// *** Indicator to identify student in foster care and authority
descriptor FosterCustodialAuthority
    documentation "This field is an indicator for whether or not a child is in foster care and what authority
                    presides over them (CYFD, Tribal Entity, or Private Entity)."
    is optional
// END: Chang ID 252617 Foster Care


// START: Chang ID 252618 Gifted Students
// *** Tracking case manager for gifted and twice exceptional students
domain entity EdFi.Staff
    documentation "A reference to the Staff member designated as the gifted student's teacher."
    is optional
    role name GiftedStaff
// END: Chang ID 252618 Gifted Students